ier County","/arc-plc/nebraska/frontier-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 that same pair ran 37% of normal, while August to September came in at 162% in 2025. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 7% of normal and January to February at 18%.</p>"}
